.Dd November 15, 2026
.Dt DTRACE_ENABLE 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm dtrace_enable
.Nd enable a DTrace probe
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Fn dtrace_enable probe flags event
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm enables the probe identified by
.Fa probe .
.Fa flags
must be zero.
.Pp
.Fa event
is
.Dv Handle::NONE
or a user-event handle with the
.Dv SIGNAL
right.  When a per-CPU ring transitions from empty to non-empty the kernel
signals that event; a consumer waiting with
.Xr evq_wait 2
wakes and drains the rings with
.Xr dtrace_read 2 .
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width Er
.It Er EINVAL
The probe identifier is unknown or
.Fa flags
is non-zero.
.It Er EBADF
.Fa event
is not a user event.
.It Er EPERM
The caller lacks the
.Dv SIGNAL
right on
.Fa event .
.El
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
